<h1 class="mb-4">About the shop</h1>

<div class="row g-4">
  <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
    <h2 class="h5">Who runs it</h2>
    <p>
      Three mechanics in the workshop, and one person at the counter who answers the phone
      and hands the bikes back.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How we work</h2>
    <p>
      We charge by the job, not by the hour, and the list is on the wall and on this site.
      Sometimes we charge less than the list says, because a job turned out easier than we
      thought or because you have been coming here for years.
    </p>
    <p>
      We keep a record of every bike that comes through, so that when one comes back we know
      what was done to it last time.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>